WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
The Yonko are without a doubt some of the&nbsp;
strongest characters in One Piece. like Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:09.240
Mom and Kaido have ruled the New World for&nbsp;
decades because of their insanely powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:14.160
devil fruits. Whitebeard was considered the&nbsp;
world’s strongest man thanks to his absurdly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.680
destructive Tremor fruit and even Blackbeard is&nbsp;
becoming the number one threat to Luffy due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.560
his overpowered darkness fruit. Which leaves&nbsp;
a very interesting question on the table:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:31.080
What would happen if Luffy ate&nbsp;
the Yonko Devil Fruits instead?

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.800
And just like the other videos we have done in&nbsp;
this series, we will be starting all the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:41.100
back from when Luffy was a kid to see exactly how&nbsp;
he would use the fruit, if the fruit would change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:47.340
his personality at all, and most importantly&nbsp;
if each fruit will help him become pirate king.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:52.140
What you might not believe though is that even&nbsp;
though all of the Yonko’s fruits are super&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:58.740
powerful, we are going to find out that Luffy is a&nbsp;
terrible user of some of these fruits, and he may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:05.460
not even make it to the time skip. Plus, most of&nbsp;
the Yonko are just stupidly strong on their own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.440
and would probably have become an Emperor&nbsp;
even without their fruits. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:16.020
Kaido was a super powered demon oni&nbsp;
who was taking out entire countries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:20.460
as a kid. And even as a child, Big Mom&nbsp;
took out an entire village of giants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:25.020
which we have to be honest and say that&nbsp;
Luffy is nowhere close to that powerful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:29.640
so he’s going to have to be creative or&nbsp;
his pirate journey will end very quickly.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:34.920
But first, let’s begin back in the bar with&nbsp;
Shanks in chapter one. This was where child&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:39.540
Luffy first ate the devil fruit that Shanks and&nbsp;
his crew had stolen from a world government ship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:43.560
So for this scenario let’s just imagine&nbsp;
that instead of Luffy’s original fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:49.800
Shanks brought back this fruit instead. Which&nbsp;
means that when Luffy takes a massive chomp,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:55.140
the bar instantly starts to shake.&nbsp;
That’s because Luffy has just eaten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.140 --> 00:02:00.000
Whitebeard’s Gura-Gura no mi, which allows&nbsp;
the user to create massive vibrations that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.940
can literally destroy islands. In fact, we&nbsp;
saw Whitebeard use these powers to create&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:12.360
massive waves, island shattering earthquakes,&nbsp;
and even deliver face-crunching punches .

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.920
However, while this fruit is extremely&nbsp;
powerful with its raw destructive potential,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:22.080
I actually think this fruit is one of the WORST&nbsp;
abilities for Luffy to use because I can just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:27.900
imagine that ten seconds after eating the devil&nbsp;
fruit he would probably already have destroyed the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:34.020
bar. Which might mean that Shanks would have to&nbsp;
knock him out of something if Luffy can’t control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:40.320
his powers. Because one thing to keep in mind&nbsp;
is that we don’t know when Whitebeard got this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:46.020
devil fruit. To me, it makes sense that he got&nbsp;
it at God Valley when he was already an adult,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.360
so if that was true then Whitebeard would&nbsp;
have had a much better chance at controlling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:57.060
these powers than a young, reckless kid like&nbsp;
Luffy. Even Blackbeard when he first ate the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.060 --> 00:03:03.240
Tremor fruit had very little control and&nbsp;
nearly destroyed all of Marineford. So I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:07.680
personally wouldn’t want to be anywhere near&nbsp;
Earthquake Luffy because who knows when he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.820
could just lose control and break the ground&nbsp;
underneath you. Plus, I even wonder if the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:16.560
destructive nature of this devil fruit might&nbsp;
make Luffy’s personality even more reckless.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:24.180
But let’s say Shanks sticks around a bit and helps&nbsp;
Luffy learn to at least control his new powers a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:29.340
little bit, and then Luffy grows up like normal,&nbsp;
living in the jungle with Sabo and Ace. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.700
instead of throwing rubber punches ch 585,&nbsp;
Luffy punches himself in the face, now his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:37.920
training involves controlling massive vibrations.&nbsp;
Which means that even though he tries his best&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:43.560
to control his abilities, there are times&nbsp;
when kid Luffy still causes massive damage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:49.980
on the island. And this could actually lead to&nbsp;
some truly awful bad situations. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:55.080
Luffy might accidentally crush Ace, Sabo, or&nbsp;
the bandits he grew up with. He could also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.080 --> 00:04:00.480
cause so much damage that the rulers of the Goa&nbsp;
kingdom send soldiers to capture Luffy. Or if it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:06.000
is so bad, I wonder if Garp forces Luffy into the&nbsp;
marines to stop him from destroying the island.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.980
Whatever happens, I think all of this might&nbsp;
either make Luffy more hesitant to use his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:15.840
powers or on the other hand his personality&nbsp;
could change so that he cares less about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:22.260
destruction he causes. But let’s say after&nbsp;
ten years he can control his powers on land,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:27.360
and now he is ready to set out to sea. At&nbsp;
this point, he is probably a pretty strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.100
fighter even without using his devil fruit&nbsp;
powers, which is super important because if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:38.940
he makes a mistake and breaks his ship, then&nbsp;
say goodbye to Earthquake Luffy. So even with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:43.200
just his base strength, he goes through&nbsp;
the East Blue without much difficulty,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:50.880
but then the real problems occur when he&nbsp;
faces his first major challenge in Alabasta.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:56.940
Because Luffy’s fight against the sand fruit user,&nbsp;
Crocodile, was the first time he was truly tested&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:02.340
in the story. And there is almost no chance&nbsp;
that Luffy can beat Crocodile with just his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:07.680
base strength which would mean he has to use his&nbsp;
tremor abilities. However, since this is the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.380
time he is using his powers in a life or death&nbsp;
situation, I think it is completely reasonable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:19.260
to think he could cause massive destruction to&nbsp;
the capital city of Alabasta. Which means that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.360
even if he defeats Crocodile, he would probably&nbsp;
have killed tons of civilians in the process,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:29.220
which would make him less of a hero and&nbsp;
more of an extremely wanted villain.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:36.360
Which will send his bounty sky high, but not&nbsp;
in a good way. And if this continues on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:40.980
islands that he visits, then eventually&nbsp;
the marines would have no choice but to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:46.260
send a strong fighter such as an admiral to put&nbsp;
an end to Earthquake Luffy’s pirate adventure.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:52.560
So yeah, it’s not all about just&nbsp;
having a super strong devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:58.800
but more important to have the right devil&nbsp;
fruit for the right person at the right time.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:05.760
Which is why this next devil fruit is actually a&nbsp;
perfect match for Luffy to eat as a kid. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:11.280
let’s head back to chapter one, and now it is&nbsp;
this fruit that has caught Luffy’s hungry eyes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:18.420
And with a single bite, all of a sudden the slab&nbsp;
of meat that is on Luffy's plate suddenly starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:25.740
talking to the very confused Luffy. And before&nbsp;
Luffy can shove the talking piece of meat in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:31.800
his mouth, Shanks absolutely loses his mind&nbsp;
that Luffy has just eaten the Soul Fruit.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:39.840
Now as a reminder, this fruit allows the user to&nbsp;
take pieces of soul and use them to turn objects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:46.260
plants, or animals into actual intelligent&nbsp;
creatures. So that hunk of meat on Luffy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:52.980
plate can now talk and think for itself. We saw&nbsp;
Big Mom use this fruit to create entire islands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:58.980
full of homies, such as this entire forest full&nbsp;
of living trees and animals. Even her ship was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:05.460
given a piece of soul so it could sing. Now&nbsp;
Big Mom could take souls from other people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:09.780
but the important part for Luffy is&nbsp;
that Big Mom could also use her own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:14.760
soul to create extra powerful homies,&nbsp;
like her cloud, sun, and hat-sword,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:20.580
or she could take souls from other people, which&nbsp;
if she took too much would kill the person.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:25.500
So as you might imagine, this is yet another&nbsp;
devil fruit that is going to take a ton of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:32.160
practice for Luffy to learn how to use. However,&nbsp;
it isn’t quite as dangerous as the Tremor fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:36.480
so he should be able to spend a lot of&nbsp;
time mastering the devil fruit during his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:41.820
years growing up. The only real danger&nbsp;
I can see is that Luffy would have too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:45.720
much fun creating homies that he&nbsp;
uses up all of his own lifespan.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:50.880
But let’s imagine that Shanks warns him&nbsp;
against using too much of his own soul.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:56.220
And maybe Ace and Sabo will let Luffy&nbsp;
take some of their soul to use for fun,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:03.540
and before Luffy leaves the island he has created&nbsp;
three main homies that he is going to take with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:08.580
him. We have this cloud that lets him fly around&nbsp;
easily, a super powerful homie staff that Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:12.720
has learned to fight with. Which basically&nbsp;
makes him like kid Goku at this point. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:17.520
then of course his new straw hat homie, which&nbsp;
is mostly just a friend for him to talk to.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:26.780
With these three, Luffy sets off on his journey.&nbsp;
The East Blue is again no problem at all since he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:33.420
is strong enough on his own. Plus he can now fly,&nbsp;
so he could technically skip islands. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:37.020
I do think he would still get a ship&nbsp;
since he would probably think it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:41.160
no fun to just skip every island along the&nbsp;
way. And with the help of his cloud homie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:46.380
defeating Crocodile in Alabasta is no&nbsp;
problem because the cloud can send rain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:51.300
down on the sand fruit user, allowing&nbsp;
Luffy to smack Crocodile with his staff.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:58.740
Next, going to Skypiea would be much simpler&nbsp;
since the cloud homie could expand to carry the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:04.020
straw hat’s whole ship up to the sky islands. And&nbsp;
fighting against Enel would be super interesting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:09.960
because I wonder if the cloud homie could absorb&nbsp;
all of Enel’s lighting or even the lightning user&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:18.060
himself. Either way, Luffy would eventually find&nbsp;
a clever way to defeat Enel or at least make it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:23.040
so that his massive thundercloud is no longer&nbsp;
a threat before Enel flies away to the moon.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.180
Which brings us to Water 7. And here&nbsp;
Soul Luffy would easily be able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:31.500
catch up to the secret agents who took Robin&nbsp;
because of his cloud homie’s flying ability,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:38.160
which would allow the straw hats to defeat&nbsp;
them before even reaching Enies Lobby. Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:43.080
flying really is the most OP ability in the story.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:49.440
That means Luffy’s next challenge is Thriller&nbsp;
Bark, which come on, is this really even a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:56.220
challenge? But it might be cool to see homies&nbsp;
versus zombies. However, then the crew heads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.220 --> 00:10:01.260
to Sabaody, which is where we get our first&nbsp;
massive change in Soul Luffy’s journey. That’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:06.960
because with the help of his cloud, Luffy and&nbsp;
the crew would have a much easier time escaping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:12.420
the cyborg Pacifistas and Admiral Kizaru after&nbsp;
Luffy punched the celestial dragon. This means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:17.580
that the entire crew escapes unharmed, although&nbsp;
they have to leave their ship there for now.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:23.520
But this brings us to the most important change&nbsp;
in Soul Luffy’s journey. Because it is right at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:28.140
this time that Ace is about to be executed at&nbsp;
Marineford. So let’s assume that Luffy and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:33.420
crew find out about this somehow, and Luffy is&nbsp;
dead set on going to save him at Impel Down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:38.100
However, unlike the original story where Luffy&nbsp;
went through with his crazy prison break idea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:42.480
this time he has Nami around to knock&nbsp;
some sense into him. And since they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:47.520
can fly around on the cloud, they simply wait&nbsp;
until Ace is being transported to Marineford,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:53.520
swoop down to the marine ship, and rescue Ace&nbsp;
without even needing to go through the Summit War.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:59.040
Wow, that was actually super easy. Which&nbsp;
also means that Whitebeard doesn’t need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:03.300
to die at Marineford, and the crew next&nbsp;
meet up with the Emperor of the Sea to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:08.880
drop off Ace. And I’m sure Whitebeard would&nbsp;
be super grateful for the crew saving Ace,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:13.320
which means that he might even teach the Straw Hat&nbsp;
Crew haki and let them train with his commanders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:19.140
as thanks. Which is extra important since we&nbsp;
are not having the normal two year timeskip.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:24.540
I also wonder what other creative ways Luffy&nbsp;
would come up with to use his fruit. Maybe some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:30.240
combo attacks using Brooks's Soul powers. Plus&nbsp;
maybe he could make poneglyphs into homies and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:35.220
they could tell them more of the ancient&nbsp;
history. I’m sure Robin would love that

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.800
Now with the haki-buffed crew&nbsp;
ready to enter the New World,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:43.260
it’s time to drop a controversial take because&nbsp;
I think that even though things have gone pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:48.060
smoothly so far, I’m pretty sure that Soul&nbsp;
Luffy would be weaker than the original.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:55.020
Because we have to remember that Big Mom was&nbsp;
a monster as a child. She took out an entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.020 --> 00:12:00.300
village of giants at the age of five. There is&nbsp;
no way Luffy could do that. And when fighting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:05.640
Big Mom doesn’t use her devil fruit all that&nbsp;
much, except for the elemental abilities and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:11.220
her giant sword. She is essentially just a&nbsp;
brawler who has insane levels of strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:16.740
durability, and haki. So what this means is that&nbsp;
Soul Luffy would definitely need to train extra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:21.600
hard with his haki since he doesn’t have the power&nbsp;
boosts that came from his original devil fruit.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:25.800
But let’s assume that he does this, and&nbsp;
combined with his creative use of homies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:30.420
he goes through the New World without too&nbsp;
much trouble. This takes us to his inevitable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:35.940
clashes with Big Mom and Kaido, where it&nbsp;
is hard to say what would happen. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:42.120
these fights most often come down to advanced&nbsp;
haki abilities, but I do think Luffy could use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:48.180
his devil fruit in more creative ways to help&nbsp;
during the battle. So in the end, I think Soul&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:53.820
Luffy would come out on top just like in the&nbsp;
original, and continue to find the One Piece.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:13:00.180
However, even though Soul Luffy was pretty OP,&nbsp;
even that version of Luffy simply cannot compare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:06.840
with the god-like powers of Chop Chop Luffy. And&nbsp;
I’m actually not kidding, because in case you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:13.500
forgot Buggy the Clown is technically a Yonko now&nbsp;
which qualifies him for this video and his Chop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:18.660
devil fruit powers are so completely perfect&nbsp;
for Luffy that he might even be able to do an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:23.280
ultra speed run of the grand line and find the&nbsp;
One Piece in less than a year. Don’t believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:28.620
me? Then listen to this. This power lets you&nbsp;
separate your body into pieces which basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:33.240
makes you immune to swords. You can also fly&nbsp;
as long as your feet stay on the ground. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:39.240
I can just imagine Luffy finding all sorts of&nbsp;
creative ways to use this power, but I’m now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:44.880
thinking about how incredible this fruit would be&nbsp;
if Luffy could combine it with his current devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.140
fruit. I mean Blackbeard has two devil fruits&nbsp;
so maybe it would be possible for Luffy. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:53.340
means that if you combine rubber and the chop&nbsp;
abilities then… Okay, hold on wait. This idea of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:57.540
Luffy eating two fruits is really interesting,&nbsp;
so let's save it for a future video, and make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:02.520
sure to subscribe if you want to see how Luffy&nbsp;
having two devil fruits would work in the story.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:09.000
And since we are saving Buggy’s fruit,&nbsp;
let’s move on to one of the biggest devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:15.720
fruit powers in the story. So back in the&nbsp;
bar when Luffy takes a bite of this and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:24.120
immediately transforms into a little red dragon&nbsp;
and starts spitting fire everywhere. That’s right,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:29.040
this is going to be Dragon Luffy.&nbsp;
However, there is a lot of confusion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:33.000
around Kaido’s devil fruit because&nbsp;
it's officially the Fish fruit Model:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:37.860
Seriyu, which is a famous blue dragon. And&nbsp;
since it is based on an old Japanese myth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:45.780
we aren’t sure if you turn into a fish first&nbsp;
and then later awaken his dragon abilities or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:51.000
if it works like Momonoske’s version of the fruit&nbsp;
and you turn into a dragon right from the start?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.540
Since we don’t know, let’s&nbsp;
go with the more exciting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.800
option and assume that Luffy will be a&nbsp;
dragon right away. Although honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:04.080
it would be hilarious to see Luffy trying to&nbsp;
fight his way to the grand line as tiny fish.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:12.240
Anyway, Luffy can now become a dragon who&nbsp;
has the mind-blowing ability to control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:16.680
elements such as shooting out a giant&nbsp;
blast breath, calling down lightning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:22.680
and sending razor sharp gusts of wind. Which&nbsp;
means that by the time Luffy sets out at age 17,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:29.040
he is a legendary creature with&nbsp;
incredible natural powers. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:34.260
before we start we need to make a serious&nbsp;
disclaimer. Because just like Big Mom, Kaido&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:40.980
was an absolute powerhouse fighter who was able to&nbsp;
join the legendary Rocks crew even before he got&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:47.700
his legendary devil fruit. Which means that his&nbsp;
base power is absurdly high, which if I’m being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:53.280
honest we probably cannot say about seventeen&nbsp;
year old Luffy when he starts his journey.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:16:00.600
And unlike when Luffy had his cloud homie, I&nbsp;
do think Dragon Luffy would fly around more and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:05.760
skip islands. That’s because as a dragon&nbsp;
he is literally the king of the beasts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:10.440
which might make Luffy more arrogant and not&nbsp;
bother with some of the smaller islands like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:15.120
Syrup Village. However, maybe Zoro would&nbsp;
challenge him to not use his dragon form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.420
so he might still get some&nbsp;
practice in normal or hybrid forms.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:23.700
The first half of the grand line would still&nbsp;
be a piece of cake because of the sheer power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:29.040
Luffy can use as a dragon. He can bring&nbsp;
down rain to help defeat Crocodile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.920
match lightning powers with&nbsp;
Enel, and if I’m being honest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:37.560
he would probably wipe out CP9 before they&nbsp;
even came close to escaping with Robin.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:41.760
However, let’s assume that Thriller Bark&nbsp;
and Sabaody go as usual, and the crew gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:46.800
separated. Luffy ends up on Amazon Lily and&nbsp;
finds out about Ace’s execution. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:53.280
he wants to go save Ace, and this is where the&nbsp;
story is going to change dramatically. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:59.820
there is no way that Dragon Luffy is waiting to&nbsp;
sneak on a marine ship. Instead, he would probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:06.000
fly to Impel Down himself and just start to&nbsp;
destroy the place with his blast breaths. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:12.840
once he got inside the prison, things would be&nbsp;
MUCH MORE difficult. Since there is less space&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:18.180
inside the prison, he wouldn’t be able to use&nbsp;
his big dragon form, which at this point I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:24.000
would still be his most powerful since he doesn’t&nbsp;
know haki. So that means getting down to save Ace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:29.940
would probably fail just like in the original&nbsp;
story and he would have to go to Marineford.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:36.300
Which is going to end so badly for Dragon Luffy.&nbsp;
And that’s because since Luffy’s dragon form is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:41.460
so powerful, he probably would not have the&nbsp;
massive levels of battle experience he would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:46.080
need to make a difference during this epic&nbsp;
war. That means he would likely HAVE TO use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:52.320
his big dragon form to have any effect on this&nbsp;
legendary battlefield. So with this big dragon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:57.000
shooting fire, lightning, and wind gusts,&nbsp;
I think the admirals would have no choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:02.100
but to team up and take out Luffy before&nbsp;
he destroys all of Marineford. And maybe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:08.400
you could say that Whitebeard would help protect&nbsp;
him, but honestly, since he is such a big target&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:13.680
I think Luffy would just take too much damage&nbsp;
from Kizaru’s light beams and Akainu’s magma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:19.260
which unfortunately means that Dragon Luffy&nbsp;
doesn’t even make it to the New World.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:28.080
However, not even Dragon Luffy’s outcome is&nbsp;
as surprising as what is going to happen next.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:34.020
Because back in the bar Luffy chomps down&nbsp;
on this innocent looking fruit and a pool&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:40.200
of darkness instantly sucks all of his friends&nbsp;
into the floor. Which makes Luffy completely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:45.360
freaks out until he somehow manages to&nbsp;
spit everyone back out moments later.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:53.640
Welcome to the story, Darkness Luffy. And Shanks&nbsp;
would probably throw a major fit over Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:58.800
eating this particular fruit, but this might&nbsp;
be one of the most interesting scenarios for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:04.140
an alternate devil fruit. Because one thing we&nbsp;
haven’t discussed yet is that if Luffy eats a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:10.680
different fruit, then someone else would likely&nbsp;
get Luffy’s original fruit. Let’s assume Shanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:16.380
still has the Nika fruit AND he plans to give&nbsp;
it to Ace, then that would mean that Luffy and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:24.120
Ace would have the darkness and Sun God fruits.&nbsp;
Which would be just a mind-blowing turn of events,

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:29.460
And because the Darkness fruit belongs to the&nbsp;
main villain of the story, we actually know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:36.720
quite a bit about its abilities. It is a special&nbsp;
logia that allows the user to produce darkness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:42.360
which kind of acts like a pocket dimension&nbsp;
that can suck things in and crush them with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:46.800
darkness. But the most important ability&nbsp;
that darkness Luffy will use is the one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:50.700
that allows him to suck in other devil&nbsp;
fruit users and take away their powers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:55.920
as long as he is touching them. Which is&nbsp;
a broken ability in a world where most of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:01.680
the strong fighters are devil fruit users. The&nbsp;
only downside is that Darkness Luffy won’t get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:06.840
the normal logia invincibility since it instead&nbsp;
absorbs all of the damage that he takes. Ouch.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:12.780
Which brings us to the nature of this devil&nbsp;
fruit. And honestly, I think that it gets a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:19.140
bad rap because we see it used by Blackbeard,&nbsp;
but there is nothing that tells us this power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:24.360
is naturally evil. I mean it was originally&nbsp;
found by this guy, and can you imagine him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:29.400
turning into a super villain if he ate the&nbsp;
fruit? So that means we can’t assume that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:35.040
Darkness Luffy is automatically Evil Luffy, it&nbsp;
just means he has some pretty amazing powers.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:42.900
However, I do think that this devil fruit would be&nbsp;
quite tough for Luffy to use, at least at first. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:47.880
mean, I can’t really see him crushing tons of&nbsp;
people and buildings with his darkness. Plus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:52.920
absorbing all damage would be particularly painful&nbsp;
for Luffy since he is usually such a straight up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:57.780
kind of fighter. And even worse, Darkness Luffy&nbsp;
wouldn’t have his rubber to help deflect some of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:02.760
that damage. So Luffy is going to have to train&nbsp;
up his base strength and defense quite a bit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:07.320
and he may even use some sort of weapon&nbsp;
like a staff or club to help him fight.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:12.660
But his ability to negate other devil&nbsp;
fruits is such a broken power that it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:17.760
comes in handy right away. Facing Buggy? Just&nbsp;
suck him in and kick him in the balls. For the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:21.660
rest of the East Blue, he’d have to rely&nbsp;
more on his own strength, but in the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.800
I think he would reach the Grand&nbsp;
Line without too much difficulty.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:29.520
And these next few arcs are going to be&nbsp;
basically target practice for Darkness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:33.780
Luffy. Against Crocodile’s Sand, he can&nbsp;
just take away his powers. Same with Enel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:38.160
who without his lightning is like fighting&nbsp;
a cat without its claws. Honestly, though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:42.960
I do think Rob Lucci would probably be&nbsp;
a bigger challenge because he is pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:47.220
strong even without his devil fruit, but&nbsp;
I still think Luffy would come out on top.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:51.720
However, as Darkness Luffy continues toward&nbsp;
the New World, there is one other major&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:56.400
difference in the story. Since Blackbeard&nbsp;
doesn’t have his darkness fruit, there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:56.400 --> 00:22:01.140
a good chance he is still on Whitebeard's&nbsp;
crew. And if Teach hears that Luffy has the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:07.560
Darkness fruit he wanted all along, he would&nbsp;
probably come after Luffy right away. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:11.220
I don’t think he would be able to beat&nbsp;
Luffy on his own unless there was some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:16.500
kind of trick, so that means Blackbeard&nbsp;
is taken out of the story completely.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:22.380
Which if you are paying attention means that Ace&nbsp;
is never captured, so Marineford never occurs.

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:24.660
Bam. Game changed.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:29.760
However, before we move on to the New World, there&nbsp;
is one major dilemma that the crew will have to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:36.360
face. What happens when Luffy meets Roger’s former&nbsp;
right hand, Rayleigh? And this is honestly a tough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:41.520
question because we don’t know the full history&nbsp;
of the Yami Yami no mi. One theory is that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:47.880
infamous pirate Rocks previously ate the fruit,&nbsp;
and if that’s the case would Rayleigh still help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:53.460
Luffy since the straw hat captain has eaten&nbsp;
Rocks’ old fruit? I’m honestly not too sure.

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:56.520
However, let’s just say that&nbsp;
Rayleigh does help them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:56.520 --> 00:23:00.780
and even trains them a bit with haki&nbsp;
before they head into the New World.

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:04.800
And just like the early parts of the Grand&nbsp;
Line, this is going to go incredibly well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:09.720
for Darkness Luffy since he basically only&nbsp;
fights devil fruit users such as Caesar,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:15.720
Doflamingo, Katakuri, and so on. Of course, the&nbsp;
real challenge comes against Kaido and Big Mom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:21.300
but with his special abilities, I feel like&nbsp;
he would be able to overcome the two devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:25.440
fruit using Yonko and continue&nbsp;
his path to find the One Piece.

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:29.460
Which is honestly pretty surprising and not&nbsp;
what I expected AT ALL for Darkness Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:33.660
when I started writing this script. However,&nbsp;
even though Luffy made it this far with two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:38.700
out of the four Yonko fruits, these are actually&nbsp;
not even the most powerful devil fruits in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:42.960
story. In fact, many of those insane&nbsp;
devil fruits belong to the Warlords,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:47.040
so if you want to know how Luffy’s story&nbsp;
would go with fruits like Kuma’s reality&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:52.680
bending Paw fruits or Doflaminog’s String&nbsp;
fruit, you can watch this video right here.

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:56.100
Shanks for watching and I’ll&nbsp;
see you in the next one.

